~ start
Wend WovenWay: This way! Follow me!
=> END

~ puzzle_hints
match puzzle.get_progress()
	when 0:
		Wend WovenWay: We'll have to tap the rocks in a particular order to open the door.
		Wend WovenWay: But I can't remember the sequence. Maybe those altars hold a clue?
	when 1:
		Wend WovenWay: You're half-way there!
		Wend WovenWay: It looks like the second altar has a different symbol on it...
	else:
		Wend WovenWay: You did it!
		Wend WovenWay: Let's go north together.
=> END
